1
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,700
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:43,560
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,680
=Episode 12=

4
00:00:50,399 --> 00:00:51,359
Has it really been revoked?

5
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:52,719
Would I lie to you?

6
00:00:56,119 --> 00:00:56,960
We're rich.

7
00:00:57,600 --> 00:00:59,320
We're about to become rich!

8
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:00,320
(Load-Side Water Separator)
The richest of the rich.

9
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:01,439
Don't get ahead of yourself.

10
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:03,640
Revoking the prenuptial agreement
is only the first step.

11
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:04,959
Next,

12
00:01:06,439 --> 00:01:08,120
I'll make Lin Lulu cheat.

13
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:11,519
I'll make her the main one to blame
in this marriage.

14
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:14,599
After the divorce,
with a few more tricks,

15
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:17,040
we can take back all
of the Lin family's assets.

16
00:01:22,599 --> 00:01:23,760
To make all that happen,

17
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:26,040
there's one final step.

18
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,040
Su Qinglan is still alive.

19
00:01:36,719 --> 00:01:38,040
We still have to wait?

20
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,040
We've waited for two years.

21
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,319
A little longer won't hurt.

22
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,239
What's wrong?

23
00:01:51,879 --> 00:01:53,040
You look troubled.

24
00:01:53,599 --> 00:01:54,280
It's nothing.

25
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:57,400
I just felt that at the hospital today,

26
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,680
Zhang Haotian was acting strangely.

27
00:02:00,439 --> 00:02:01,159
What do you mean?

28
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:03,640
It seemed like he really fell
for Zhao Ke.

29
00:02:05,079 --> 00:02:06,680
A classic trick used by con men.

30
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,120
Don't let it get to you.

31
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:09,479
It's different.

32
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:12,400
Back when I was Jiang Lai,

33
00:02:12,919 --> 00:02:14,800
even when he asked for my opinion,

34
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,560
he always had this

35
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:20,800
condescending attitude,
like he had all the power.

36
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:22,080
But today,

37
00:02:24,319 --> 00:02:25,719
it felt like he was

38
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:28,039
begging Zhao Ke to accept his love.

39
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:31,479
You mean

40
00:02:32,199 --> 00:02:35,840
Zhao Ke could become
Zhang Haotian's weakness?

41
00:02:36,479 --> 00:02:37,400
I'm not sure.

42
00:02:37,719 --> 00:02:39,000
But I want to take the chance.

43
00:02:39,319 --> 00:02:40,919
I rejected him clearly today.

44
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:43,039
If he still comes looking for me,

45
00:02:43,719 --> 00:02:45,039
then I'll know I was right.

46
00:02:45,719 --> 00:02:46,879
But I think

47
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:49,439
Zhang Haotian's weakness

48
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,439
is money.

49
00:02:54,319 --> 00:02:56,879
We have to take everything away
from him to break him.

50
00:02:58,120 --> 00:03:00,360
Especially when he's worked so hard
to get something,

51
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:01,680
only to lose it all.

52
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:04,199
That's what will make him wish
he were dead.

53
00:03:07,919 --> 00:03:08,719
Enough.

54
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:10,080
Jiang Lai,

55
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,400
you belong on the stage.

56
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,599
Don't let revenge blind you.

57
00:03:15,599 --> 00:03:17,120
Go pursue your dreams.

58
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:19,400
But I've already...

59
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,080
Wait.

60
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:28,960
Please come in.

61
00:03:33,599 --> 00:03:35,400
This is the person I mentioned before,

62
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:37,080
the private dance instructor, Lang Yue.

63
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:38,919
Jiang Lai.

64
00:03:41,879 --> 00:03:43,280
Ms. Lang is not a stranger.

65
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:46,520
I watched your ENT competition
from two years ago.

66
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,000
You won first place.

67
00:03:49,159 --> 00:03:51,159
It was just a small competition,

68
00:03:51,159 --> 00:03:52,000
Ms. Lang.

69
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:54,599
I have a friend who was one
of the judges that night.

70
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:57,479
He said he had high hopes for the girl
named Jiang Lai.

71
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,759
He believed that one day,

72
00:03:59,759 --> 00:04:01,360
you would win the Benesh Dance
Grand Prize.

73
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:07,360
I hope you can continue.

74
00:04:07,599 --> 00:04:09,879
And I'll do everything
I can to help you.

75
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,479
You need to understand,

76
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:16,279
age is never kind to dancers.

77
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:19,120
Especially after losing so much time.

78
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:22,240
All right, Ms. Lang.

79
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:23,839
I just got a bottle of fine wine.

80
00:04:24,079 --> 00:04:24,720
Come have a taste?

81
00:04:26,279 --> 00:04:26,800
Sure.

82
00:04:54,079 --> 00:04:54,879
(What's going on?)

83
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,480
Mom!

84
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,519
Mom!

85
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:40,959
Mom, please open your eyes
and look at me!

86
00:05:40,959 --> 00:05:42,199
Mom!

87
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:48,560
Mr. Li.

88
00:05:49,519 --> 00:05:51,199
You've been watching over her here
for days.

89
00:05:51,399 --> 00:05:52,399
Get some rest.

90
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,680
I'll look after my mother-in-law.

91
00:05:54,759 --> 00:05:56,160
Someone will come to relieve me soon.

92
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,000
I'll leave when he gets here.

93
00:06:23,199 --> 00:06:25,160
Su Qinglan's secretary has been here
the whole time.

94
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,079
I can't make a move.

95
00:06:27,279 --> 00:06:28,040
The secretary?

96
00:06:28,839 --> 00:06:29,920
Then you can use him

97
00:06:29,959 --> 00:06:31,319
to get rid of Su Qinglan.

98
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:32,839
You have a way?

99
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:35,319
Mom, wake up!

100
00:06:35,319 --> 00:06:37,560
Mom! Mom!

101
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,160
I'll listen to you from now on.

102
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:40,879
Can you please wake up?

103
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:43,680
Please wake up and look at me.

104
00:06:43,759 --> 00:06:46,879
- Mom, don't leave me alone!
- Lulu.

105
00:06:46,879 --> 00:06:48,160
Mom!

106
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,959
Mom!

107
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,319
Mom!

108
00:06:52,319 --> 00:06:53,079
Making a move directly

109
00:06:53,079 --> 00:06:54,120
is too risky.

110
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:56,319
I'll first figure out this
secretary's schedule.

111
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:59,160
Then find a chance to get him
to eat some mushrooms.

112
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:02,560
Can you hear me, Mom?

113
00:07:03,439 --> 00:07:04,480
Mom!

114
00:07:04,519 --> 00:07:05,120
Lulu.

115
00:07:06,639 --> 00:07:08,040
- Lulu, don't be sad.
- Mom, wake up!

116
00:07:08,519 --> 00:07:09,839
- She passed away suddenly.
- Mom!

117
00:07:10,279 --> 00:07:12,319
The police have already started
investigating Mr. Li.

118
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,840
(Killing with a Borrowed Hand)

119
00:07:22,640 --> 00:07:26,520
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

120
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:29,400
♪I should forget you♪

121
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:34,640
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

122
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:36,600
♪To carry on♪

123
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:41,840
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

124
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:45,520
♪You no longer have the strength♪

125
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:50,320
♪You want me to go there for you♪

126
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:56,480
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

127
00:07:56,800 --> 00:08:00,640
♪Your freedom♪

128
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:06,120
♪Has become my cage♪

129
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:12,920
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

130
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:19,040
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

131
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:26,440
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

132
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:29,320
♪You told me♪

133
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:34,480
♪I would shine like a star♪

134
00:08:35,560 --> 00:08:39,520
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

135
00:08:39,520 --> 00:08:43,160
♪How to live without you♪

136
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:47,560
♪I look up♪

137
00:08:47,560 --> 00:08:50,320
♪The starry sky♪

138
00:08:50,640 --> 00:08:54,120
♪So hazy and blurred♪
